["🟠","5","Platform: 2.5 ft fill, 280 ft x 14 ft wall, 36,100 SF (4-E items 5, 9, 27)","All placeholders Haugland has flagged: $1.5M deduct if smaller, $0.6-3.5M geotech exposure if worse. Estimate is silent on direction.","GZA 2023 report; borings before IFC; NFPA 855 HMA","High"],
["🟠","6","Station 496 at $7.25M for 20 relays","$362,700 per relay; $1.81M testing and $1.39M labor on a relay swap; no unit-rate comparison in the package.","Two recent EMA relay-replacement actuals; P&C hours build-up","Medium"],
